allenge for us as a  stepping-stone towards building you know  general artificial intelligence we're  very excited about what the future holds  both in terms of Google applications you  can imagine within Google actually  taking our interactions with our many  users at Google to try and optimize how  we interact with them in addition we'd  like to consider tasks beyond that  perhaps moving into medicine one day  where we all be able to help patients  personalize their treatment by actually  using reinforcement learning to  understand which sequences of treatments  actually needs the best outcomes of  those individual patients based on their  particular track record and history  in the early days of alphago I played  against it but it was quickly apparent  that alphago is way beyond my skill  level I've not played alphago myself I'm  not strong enough but I've played  through many of the games I did play  much of yourself ago when I was first  introduced to the game and did you win
 

